# Where the pinned standard OpenAPI files in api/standards/ come from
# (docs/PLAN.md D3, brief WP-3). Each file is a byte-for-byte copy of the
# file uspace-core's SOURCE names for the same standard, at the same
# commit and SHA-256: `core_source` says which, and scripts/check-standards.sh
# compares the two offline (core's SOURCE from the module cache at the
# version go.mod pins). scripts/fetch-standards.sh re-fetches `url` and
# refuses a file whose SHA-256 is not `sha256`; CI never fetches.
#
# The generated code in internal/stdapi/<core_package>/ comes from these
# files through oapi-codegen (`generator`, the go.mod tool directive) and
# the configurations api/standards/oapi-codegen.<core_package>.<side>.yaml;
# its types are uspace-core's, generated by core from the same file.

